ce name="APP" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AISAN IND</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGAI TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAO YOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANABE YUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UEDA HIRONORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AISAN KOGYO KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAI, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAO, YOICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANABE, YUICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UEDA, HIRONORI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGAI TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAO YOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANABE YUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UEDA HIRONORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAI, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAO, YOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANABE, YUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UEDA, HIRONORI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A fuel supply pipe (43) is constituted of a fixed fuel supply pipe (43b) made of a metal such as stainless steel and connection fuel supply pipes (43a, 43c) made of, e.g., resin. The volume resistivities of the connection fuel supply pipes (43a, 43c) range from 10&lt;7&gt; to 10&lt;11&gt;  OMEGA .cm. Therefore, the electrification of fuel in flowing through the fuel supply pipes (43a, 43c) can be suppressed.  Since the electricity accumulated in the supply pipes (43a, 43c) is not discharged sharply, the supply pipe (43a) is prevented from causing spark discharge. The supply pipes (43a, 43c) each may have a multilayer structure of which the innermost layer has a volume resistivity ranging from 10&lt;7&gt; to 10&lt;11&gt;  OMEGA .cm and of which the outermost layer has a volume resistivity of 10&lt;12&gt;  OMEGA .cm or more.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un ensemble de tuyauterie d'alimentation en carburant (43). Cet ensemble est constitué d'une tuyauterie fixe d'alimentation en carburant (43b), en métal tel que de l'acier inoxydable, et de tuyauteries de raccordement d'alimentation en carburant (43a, 43c), par exemple, en résine. Les résistivités volumiques électriques des tuyauteries de raccordement (43a, 43c) sont comprises entre 10&lt;7&gt; et 10&lt;11&gt;  OMEGA .cm. Par conséquent, il est possible de supprimer l'électrification du carburant circulant dans les tuyauteries de raccordement (43a, 43c). Etant donné que l'électricité accumulée dans les tuyauteries d'alimentation (43a, 43c) n'est pas déchargée brusquement, la tuyauterie d'alimentation (43a) ne peut pas provoquer de décharge d'étincelles. Les tuyauteries d'alimentation (43a, 43c) peuvent chacune avoir une structure à multiples couches parmi lesquelles la couche située le plus à l'intérieur présente une résistivité volumique électrique comprise entre 10&lt;7&gt; et 10&lt;11&gt;  OMEGA .cm ou plus et la couche située le plus à l'extérieur présente une résistivité volumique électrique supérieure ou égale à 10&lt;12&gt;  OMEGA .cm.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>